 6. 📷 Pic du jour 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Alex Wong/Getty Images Florida Gov. Ron DeSantis (R) shows the media a coin he handed to President Trump while greeting him on the tarmac in Fort Myers, Fla., yesterday after Air Force One landed for a midterm rally.

 "YOU MISSED BITCHES," the golden coin says, rendering Trump with a raised middle finger. Someone give the governor a comma for Christmas. 

 
 
